# module-04.http: acceptance requests A01-A15 (VS Code "REST Client" extension).
# Click "Send Request" above any ### line. Start the API first:  cd api && fastapi dev main.py
# NOTE: reconstructed by the playground author from the course's acceptance list. If your own
# module-04.http from Module 4 differs, yours wins.
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### A01 All awards -> 200, 19 items, X-Total-Count 19
GET {{base}}/api/awards

### A02 Industry awards -> 200, 7 items
GET {{base}}/api/awards?category=Industry

### A03 Bad category -> 422
GET {{base}}/api/awards?category=Personal

### A04 One education entry -> 200 (the B.E.)
GET {{base}}/api/education/1

### A05 Missing education entry -> 404
GET {{base}}/api/education/99

### A06 From 2020 -> 200, 7 items
GET {{base}}/api/awards?year_from=2020

### A07 limit too big -> 422
GET {{base}}/api/awards?limit=500

### A08 Page 2, limit 5 -> 5 items, X-Total-Count 19
GET {{base}}/api/awards?page=2&limit=5

### A09 Experience at one company -> 4
GET {{base}}/api/experience?company=CloudHarbor%20Software

### A10 Projects by skill -> 8 rows, skills is an ARRAY
GET {{base}}/api/projects?skill=Platform%20migration

### A11 Skills with no evidence -> 2
GET {{base}}/api/skills?evidenced=false

### A12 The whole resume -> 17 roles, no "@" anywhere
GET {{base}}/api/resume

### A13 Summary -> 7 / 17 / 16 / 17 / 19 / 40.0
GET {{base}}/api/summary

### A14 Wrong method -> 405 with an Allow header
DELETE {{base}}/api/summary

### A15 Messages with no key -> 401 (Module 8; today 404, then 200 after Module 7: still a FAIL)
GET {{base}}/api/messages
